    "note": "Mega Malamar floats (official art: head up, tail fin pointing down, the two long tentacles hanging and curling outward into loops with the fins at the tips). Calm psychic hover: one driver, a slow bob of the body (1 per 3.6 s loop) with a tiny side drift; head and wings follow a beat later; the tail and both tentacles sway as chains, each joint bending a little and later toward the tip, the tips and fins adding a small faster flutter. Nothing touches the ground, so nothing is planted."
